range vocal level 0.2 0.35 centre stage at rest (C4), stepping back with stir and again as the machine fills
range vocal cutoff 0.5 1 opened by the orb's radius
range root level 0 0.3 the root at C2: the ambience loop tuned up 4 st
range fifth level 0 0.25 the fifth at G2, the same loop, sines only
range seventh level 0 0.12 the seventh at Bb2, a dark tone
range third level 0 0.2 the third at E3, a sine-plus-bank tone
range treble level 0 0.3 the treble vocal: grows with the machine (stack); gathers into the chord with coherence
range treble gather 0.3 1
range shimmer level 0 0.2 pure shimmer, in with stir
range spark level 0 0.15 digital interference: the pen's speed
range cloud level 0 0.25 the chord at C5, growing with the machine; spells raise it and pick the chord
bind stir vocal level 0.35 0.22
bind stack vocal level 0 -0.06 rel
bind orb.radius vocal cutoff 0.5 1
bind orb.accel vocal drive 0 0.02
bind tone.root root level 0 0.3
bind tone.fifth fifth level 0 0.25
bind tone.seventh seventh level 0 0.12
bind tone.third third level 0 0.2
bind tension third bank 0.2 0.8
bind fit root shimmer 0.3 0
bind fit fifth shimmer 0.3 0
bind stack treble level 0 0.3
bind coherence treble gather 0.3 1
bind radiance treble reverb 0.5 0.9
bind stir shimmer level 0 0.2
bind orb.curl shimmer phaser 0 0.7
bind orb.radius shimmer cutoff 0.6 1
bind orb.speed spark level 0 0.15
bind orb.curl spark cutoff 0.5 1
bind stack cloud level 0 0.25
bind coherence cloud gather 0.5 1
bind score cloud reverb 0.5 0.9
note luminal v1 (draft, 2026-09-27). Inverse register plan: textures high, chord tones low. Bass voices are brought in by tone.*, voiced
note open so a third never sits below E3; the two loop-derived voices share one recording (ambience_00002) so the bass is one instrument.
note The treble vocal is the coherence reward (gather 0.3 -> 1) and grows with stack; the cloud at C5 is the lock chord the spells pick.
note Orb: speed -> interference crackle, radius -> vocal and shimmer filters, curl -> shimmer phaser and crackle brightness.
note One-shots: sub thump + bright impact on lock, angelic chime (tuned to C5, keep-len) on accept, downer-downer-riser on unlock.
note Reserved for spell casting / the timeline, not used here: flourish_00001/2, accept_00001/2, riser_00001, electric_rise-fall,
note electromagnetic_discovery, synth_chorus_00003, synth_highlights (the last three are in the spell files).
